{"seq":3,"slug":"deformation-soft","title":"形变与软体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/destruction-systems/simulation/deformation-soft","wordCount":1818,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"形变与软体\">形变与软体</h1><p>子弹打在车门上留下一个凹坑、保险杠撞墙后弯成 V 字、布料被刮破后挂下一缕——这些都是「坏了」，却没有一块东西分离。前两篇的离散刚体范式对此无能为力：它只会把物体碎成块或保持完整，无法表达「整体改变形状但不分离」。这就是形变破坏的领域。本篇与前两篇互补，覆盖脆裂之外的另一大类破坏，引入顶点级形变与软体物理，并讲清它们在游戏里如何被驯服到可承受的开销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-形变与脆裂的分野\">核心概念：形变与脆裂的分野</h2><p>破坏的两条物理路径在 <a href=\"../foundations/destruction-overview\">破坏系统概览</a> 里已点明，这里讲清形变路径的物理本质。脆裂处理的是<strong>断裂（fracture）</strong>：材料超过强度后裂成分离碎块，映射到离散刚体 + 约束。形变处理的是<strong>应变（strain）下的连续变形</strong>：材料在受力下改变形状，分<strong>弹性形变</strong>（撤力后恢复，如橡胶、轻撞的钣金回弹）和<strong>塑性形变</strong>（撤力后保留，如凹陷的金属、弯折的杆件）。游戏里破坏关心的多是塑性形变——凹坑、弯折要留住才有「被打坏」的实感。</p>\n<p>形变的数学不再是「碎片 + 约束」，而是描述材料内部一点应力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 与应变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 关系的本构模型。最简单的线弹性服从胡克定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma = E\\,\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 为杨氏模量）；塑性则在应力超过屈服点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 后让一部分应变变为不可恢复的永久变形。游戏不会精确求解连续介质方程，而用离散近似来逼近这套行为。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[受力] --&gt; B{超过屈服点?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否, 弹性| C[形状暂时改变&lt;br/&gt;撤力后回弹]&#10;  B --&gt;|是, 塑性| D[形状永久改变&lt;br/&gt;凹陷/弯折留存]&#10;  D --&gt; E{超过断裂极限?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| F[只变形不分离&lt;br/&gt;本篇范畴]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| G[断裂分离&lt;br/&gt;回到脆裂范式]\">graph TD\n  A[受力] --&gt; B{超过屈服点?}\n  B --&gt;|否, 弹性| C[形状暂时改变&lt;br/&gt;撤力后回弹]\n  B --&gt;|是, 塑性| D[形状永久改变&lt;br/&gt;凹陷/弯折留存]\n  D --&gt; E{超过断裂极限?}\n  E --&gt;|否| F[只变形不分离&lt;br/&gt;本篇范畴]\n  E --&gt;|是| G[断裂分离&lt;br/&gt;回到脆裂范式]</pre><p>下表把脆裂与形变两条路径并排，帮助按现象选方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>脆裂（前两篇）</th>\n<th>形变（本篇）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>现象</td>\n<td>碎成分离的块</td>\n<td>改变形状不分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据范式</td>\n<td>碎片 + 约束图</td>\n<td>网格顶点位移场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型材料</td>\n<td>混凝土、玻璃、岩石</td>\n<td>金属、橡胶、布料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主方法</td>\n<td>刚体 + 应变传播</td>\n<td>顶点形变 / 软体 / FEM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>留存效果</td>\n<td>碎块散落</td>\n<td>凹坑、弯折、褶皱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"顶点级形变-游戏里最常用的近似\">顶点级形变：游戏里最常用的近似</h2><p>游戏里最普遍、最便宜的形变不是真软体模拟，而是<strong>顶点级形变</strong>：直接在受击点附近推动网格顶点产生位移，留下凹坑。它不解任何物理方程，本质是一个空间衰减函数——受击点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处位移最大，离得越远位移越小：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext> </mtext><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=