\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2079em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为静止长度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为劲度系数），每帧对所有质点积分。它实现简单、直观，是布料、绳索、软体球的常见做法；缺点是参数难调（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 太大数值发散、太小软趴趴），且不直接对应真实材料常数。布料是这一族最典型的应用（布料模拟属游戏物理 hub 的 <a href=\"../../game-physics/fluid-and-softbody/cloth-simulation\">布料模拟</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>有限元法（FEM）</strong>：把物体剖分成四面体网格，每个四面体作为一个有限元，按连续介质力学计算其应变能和内力。FEM 物理精度高、能直接用真实材料参数（杨氏模量、泊松比、屈服强度），还能自然统一形变与断裂——当某个四面体的应变超过断裂阈值，就在那里产生裂纹，于是「先弯折后撕裂」可以连续发生。代价是计算量大、实现复杂，过去多见于离线影视，但 2026 年随着 GPU 求解器成熟，实时 FEM 在高端项目里逐渐可用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[需要形变] --&gt; B{要不要结构整体性?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否, 只要表面凹坑| C[顶点级形变&lt;br/&gt;衰减位移, 极便宜]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D{精度 vs 开销}&#10;  D --&gt;|够用即可| E[质点-弹簧&lt;br/&gt;布料/绳索/软球]&#10;  D --&gt;|要真实材料+断裂统一| F[有限元 FEM&lt;br/&gt;四面体, 贵但准]\">flowchart TD\n  A[需要形变] --&gt; B{要不要结构整体性?}\n  B --&gt;|否, 只要表面凹坑| C[顶点级形变&lt;br/&gt;衰减位移, 极便宜]\n  B --&gt;|是| D{精度 vs 开销}\n  D --&gt;|够用即可| E[质点-弹簧&lt;br/&gt;布料/绳索/软球]\n  D --&gt;|要真实材料+断裂统一| F[有限元 FEM&lt;br/&gt;四面体, 贵但准]</pre><h2 id=\"与脆裂的统一及工程取舍\">与脆裂的统一及工程取舍</h2><p>最真实的破坏其实是形变与脆裂的连续统一：材料先弹性变形、超屈服点后塑性变形、再超断裂极限才裂开。FEM 天然能表达这条完整链路，这也是它在追求顶级真实感的项目里的吸引力所在。但绝大多数游戏不需要、也付不起这种统一——它们用「混搭」务实地逼近：钣金用顶点形变做凹坑、玻璃用脆裂碎成片、布料用质点弹簧、需要弯折的少数关键物体才上 FEM。</p>\n<p>选型时的工程取舍可归纳为：要不要永久留存（要 → 塑性）、要不要结构整体性（不要 → 顶点形变就够，要 → 软体）、精度与开销如何权衡（够用 → 质点弹簧，要真实且统一断裂 → FEM）、是否联机（软体状态海量且数值敏感，联机时强烈倾向只在客户端做表现、不参与权威状态，见 <a href=\"../systems/destruction-networking\">破坏网络同步</a>）。无论选哪条，形变的开销都要纳入统一的破坏预算（见 <a href=\"../practice/performance-budget-destruction\">性能预算</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>形变破坏处理「改变形状但不分离」，与脆裂互补：分弹性（回弹）与塑性（永久），游戏关心能留住凹坑弯折的塑性。</li>\n<li>顶点级形变是最便宜常用的近似：用衰减位移函数在受击点附近戳坑，不解物理方程、可叠加，赛车车损与金属弹坑的主力；局限是不懂结构。</li>\n<li>需要结构整体性时上软体：质点-弹簧（按胡克定律，简单但参数难调，布料/绳索常用）或有限元 FEM（四面体、真实材料参数、能统一形变与断裂，准但贵，2026 年 GPU 求解让实时可用）。</li>\n<li>最真实的破坏是形变→断裂的连续统一（FEM 可表达），但多数游戏务实混搭：钣金顶点形变、玻璃脆裂、布料弹簧、关键件才上 FEM；联机时软体优先做客户端表现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>另一条路径：<a href=\"rigid-body-debris\">刚体碎块</a>、<a href=\"constraints-structural\">结构约束与连接</a>；两范式总览：<a href=\"../foundations/destruction-overview\">破坏系统概览</a></li>\n<li>开销纳入预算：<a href=\"../practice/performance-budget-destruction\">性能预算</a>；联机表现取舍：<a href=\"../systems/destruction-networking\">破坏网络同步</a></li>\n<li>跨库：软体与可形变体的通用模拟，见游戏物理 hub 的 <a href=\"../../game-physics/fluid-and-softbody/deformable-bodies\">可形变体</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"形变与软体","id":"形变与软体"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：形变与脆裂的分野","id":"核心概念-形变与脆裂的分野"},{"level":2,"text":"顶点级形变：游戏里最常用的近似","id":"顶点级形变-游戏里最常用的近似"},{"level":2,"text":"软体物理：质点弹簧与有限元","id":"软体物理-质点弹簧与有限元"},{"level":2,"text":"与脆裂的统一及工程取舍","id":"与脆裂的统一及工程取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"结构约束与连接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/destruction-systems/simulation/constraints-structural"},"next":{"title":"混沌物理破坏系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/destruction-systems/systems/chaos-physics-destruction"}}